Output demo/analyze.gif

Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1200
Set Height 600
Set Padding 20
Set TypingSpeed 50ms

Type "mueta analyze 'test_audio/First Love - 宇多田ヒカル.flac'"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 5s

Type "mueta view-meta 'test_audio/First Love - 宇多田ヒカル.flac'"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 5s

Type "mueta analyze test_audio/ -r"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 10s
Ctrl+C
